OL,3,GNEWSANew law would cut e-bike fires,   
OL,4,Ainquest hears                          
OL,6,FA new law would cut the number of fatal
OL,7,Ffires caused by problems with e-bike   
OL,8,Fand e-scooter batteries, a barrister   
OL,9,Fhas suggested to a coroner.            
OL,11,FMiles Bennett suggested the "simple"   
OL,12,Fsolution when questioning staff from a 
OL,13,Fgovernment regulator's office during an
OL,14,Finquest into a fire which left a mother
OL,15,Fand her two children dead in Cambridge.
OL,17,FGemma Germeney, 31, Lilly Peden, eight,
OL,18,Fand Oliver Peden, four, died after the 
OL,19,Ffire in a flat in Sackville Close on 30
OL,20,FJune 2023.                             
