OL,3,GNEWSANew law would cut e-bike fires,   
OL,4,Ainquest hears                          
OL,6,FCoroner Elizabeth Gray, who is         
OL,7,Foverseeing an inquest into their       
OL,8,Fdeaths, heard that a problematic       
OL,9,Fbattery on an e-bike owned by          
OL,10,FGermeney's partner, Scott Peden, was   
OL,11,Fthe "focus" of an investigation.       
